==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[annat]]

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la}} {{lena}} {{term|annata}} income of a year, also, of half a year, from {{etyl|la}} {{lena}} {{term|annus}} year: compare {{etyl|fr}} {{term|annate}} annats.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{legal|Scotland}} A half year's [[stipend]], over and above what is owing for the [[incumbency]], due to a [[minister]]'s [[heir]]s after his [[decease]].

{{Webster 1913}}

